# Kind $97's wait (ActorKind97Wait, $83:93B9: JSL Kind97WaitWork) with
# the record's $07 bit 0 clear: Kind97WaitWork's RTS at $84:A001. As
# cov_kind97_wait.box (stage a5 s1, the kind $97 record $0BAB at frame 30
# given $09 $C0 and a wait of 3 frames), with its $07 made $80.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s1.state
wait 30
poke 000BB2 80
poke 000BB4 C0
poke 000BAC 03
wait 10
